sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as 玩家
    participant UI as MainFrame
    participant Game
    participant AI as GomokuAi
    participant Rules as ForbiddenAnalyzer
    participant Store as AppStore

    P->>UI: 选择人机对战并设置难度、禁手
    UI->>Game: new Game(PVE)
    Game-->>UI: 新对局，黑棋先行
    UI-->>P: 显示空棋盘

    P->>UI: 点击交叉点落子
    UI->>Game: click(x,y)
    Game->>Rules: 校验空点、禁手、连五
    Rules-->>Game: 合法且未终局
    Game-->>UI: PlaceResult 落子成功，换手
    UI-->>P: 刷新棋盘

    UI->>AI: choose(game)
    AI->>Rules: 评估成五、堵四、冲三
    Rules-->>AI: 候选点分值
    AI-->>UI: 选中坐标
    UI->>Game: commit(aiX,aiY)
    Game->>Rules: 校验并判定胜负
    Rules-->>Game: 连五 / 未终局 / 满盘
    Game-->>UI: PlaceResult

    alt 对局结束
        UI->>Store: recordResult
        Store-->>UI: 写入 Elo 与排行
        UI-->>P: 弹出对局结束
    else 对局未结束
        UI-->>P: 等待玩家继续落子
    end
